    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p style="color:var(--ink-soft);">Last updated: October 2026</p>
    <h2>1. Who We Are</h2>
    <p>GoOrganicAfrica is an agricultural education, information and digital-product platform operated from Nigeria. Our contact email is <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>
    <h2>2. Information We May Collect</h2>
    <p>Depending on how you use the website, we may receive information you voluntarily provide, such as your name, email address, telephone number and messages when you contact us.</p>
    <p>The Farm Profit Calculator may store preferences in your browser. Calculator inputs are used to produce your requested estimate and are not intended to be a substitute for professional financial or agricultural advice.</p>
    <h2>3. How We Use Information</h2>
    <p>Information may be used to respond to enquiries, provide requested services or digital products, improve the website and calculator, maintain security, understand website usage, and comply with applicable legal obligations.</p>
    <h2>4. Cookies and Similar Technologies</h2>
    <p>GoOrganicAfrica may use cookies, browser local storage and similar technologies for functionality, preferences, analytics and, when enabled, advertising. See our <a href="/cookie-policy/">Cookie Policy</a> for more information.</p>
    <h2>5. Google Services and Advertising</h2>
    <p>If Google Analytics is enabled, Google may process information about website usage for analytics. If Google AdSense is enabled after approval, Google and its advertising partners may use cookies or similar technologies to serve, measure and personalise advertising according to applicable settings, consent requirements and Google's policies.</p>
    <p>GoOrganicAfrica does not control Google's processing of information. Visitors should review Google's applicable privacy information and advertising controls.</p>
    <h2>6. Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p>The website may link to or use third-party services including WhatsApp, Selar, Google services, hosting providers and other external platforms. Those providers may process information under their own privacy policies and terms when you interact with their services.</p>
    <h2>7. Data Sharing</h2>
    <p>We do not intend to sell personal information. Information may be shared with service providers where reasonably necessary to operate the website, deliver a requested service, process a transaction, maintain security or comply with law.</p>
    <h2>8. Data Retention and Security</h2>
    <p>We aim to retain personal information only for as long as reasonably necessary for the purpose for which it was collected or as required by applicable law. No internet transmission or storage system can be guaranteed to be completely secure.</p>
    <h2>9. Your Choices and Rights</h2>
    <p>You can control cookies and browser storage through your browser settings. You may also contact us to ask about personal information we hold about you or to request correction or deletion where applicable. Requests can be sent to <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>
    <h2>10. International Visitors</h2>
    <p>GoOrganicAfrica is operated from Nigeria, but visitors may access the website from other countries. Where third-party services process information across borders, their own privacy terms and applicable legal safeguards may apply.</p>
    <h2>11. Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p>Our website is intended for a general audience and is not directed specifically at children. We do not knowingly request personal information from children for the purpose of creating accounts or purchasing products.</p>
    <h2>12. Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this Privacy Policy when our services, technology or legal obligations change. The updated version will be published on this page with a revised date.</p>
